stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> NO_AUTHORITY
  NO_AUTHORITY --> READY: acquire epoch + persist fencing token
  READY --> OPEN: BeginCheckpoint CAS
  OPEN --> PARTIAL: first valid RankPrepared
  OPEN --> ABORTED: cancel / deadline / validation failure
  PARTIAL --> PARTIAL: duplicate valid prepare (idempotent)
  PARTIAL --> PUBLISHING: both ranks valid at same position/topology
  PARTIAL --> ABORTED: cancel / epoch loss / prepare failure
  PUBLISHING --> COMMITTED: certificate CAS succeeds or identical exists
  PUBLISHING --> RECONCILING: timeout / connection loss
  RECONCILING --> COMMITTED: authority query finds certificate
  RECONCILING --> ABORTED: authority query finds abort
  RECONCILING --> PARTIAL: authority says operation still open and epoch valid
  READY --> NO_AUTHORITY: authority unavailable / lease lost
  OPEN --> NO_AUTHORITY: authority lost; stop mutation and reconcile
  PARTIAL --> NO_AUTHORITY: authority lost; stop mutation and reconcile
  COMMITTED --> [*]
  ABORTED --> [*]
